# Backend — Advanced

Enable when rule level includes `advanced`. Defaults (`validation.mdc`, `database.mdc`) still apply.

- Idempotent writes where retries are likely (payments, webhooks)
- Rate-limit auth and expensive endpoints
- Audit trail for admin / money / PII changes when domain requires it
- Explicit pagination on list endpoints
- Upload allowlists; store outside public tree when possible
- Version or document API contracts before wide UI coupling
- Background/queue jobs only when concept needs them — do not add for show
